    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752080/extras/b5ca70489953e0e78be8c1c4773221f1.avif?t=1719511240\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2>A <strong>retro-style, puzzle game</strong> in which your task is to <strong>push</strong> the <strong>green square</strong> in place of the red one in as <strong>few moves as possible</strong>.<br>However, not everything is as it seems. At some point, the player starts to experience strange anomalies and bugs of strange origin.<br>Something is hidden inside the game? Not something but someone. Solve the mystery of the strange entity trapped inside this simple puzzle game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752080/extras/79e6153fb79ad561daa69501a37e177f.avif?t=1719511240\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> More than 50 different levels<br></li><li> Engaging puzzle solving<br></li><li> A dark, mysterious story<br></li><li> Easter eggs to discover<br></li><li> An out-of-the-box approach to storytelling</li></ul><br><strong>more Information Coming Soon...</strong>",
